message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below. Do not mix it with the deprecated version 1.1."
type: dataset
title: "IWCS v2: A Simulator-Traceable Run-Level Dataset of Normal Operation and Four Attack Conditions in Simulated Low-Power Wireless Sensor Networks"
version: 2.0.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24224309
date-released: 2026-11-15
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Electrosvalnunes/iwcs-dataset-omnetpp-iiot-wsn-attacks"
authors:
